; The program of two_tokens_every, its matches counted as keys: the rows a
; match selects for its patterns, in order.  Taking the two tokens in either
; order is one commit and two keys.  every must commit both keys, which take
; the same rows, so it has no step; unique sees two matches.  The other
; disciplines step as before.
(matches keys)
(tok)
(tok)
(rule pair (take (tok) (tok)) (make (pair)))
